here with the card for one day, then without; a new card is introduced on its first row's first fluency day, with
the teacher holding the model. A row whose model_in names a card it does not receive from its own assumed row
(progression read 2026-11-19, finding 9) gets it from the card's first row in the band; no model is used before its
introducing unit.

