| g4-sm-set-goal (SEL unit 2) | g4-phw-goal-plan | 8 (grade 4 weeks 1 to 4) | Health comes first in the year by design |
| g4-sa-feel-think-link (SEL unit 4) | g4-meh-same-thing-different-people | 11 (grade 4 weeks 16 to 19) | If SEL comes first, health's day 1 retrieves the two-chain idea; if later, health's case stands alone |
