t, if-then chart. Cost: $3 printing | After unit 8 so the year opens with the plan SEL leans on; before unit 10, whose emergency day uses the decide-with-help sort. Science grade 4 teaches body structures later, so health states its germ fact itself with its source (Cross-subject) | Candidate: HECAT PHW module 3-5 read may add "hearing and vision checks" and "food safety at home"; one line each inside day 1 | Conditions: never ask about conditions in the room; a condition is never a blame or a weakness; a student with asthma, an allergy or diabetes is never asked to explain theirs. Pictures only of inhalers and injectors. Vaccines: a plain fact, no illness stories, no debate staged; a family's choices are never discussed. Agent reads: sensitivity (conditions sources named in the brief) |
