339: 
340: The SEL 3 to 5 rows lean on health rows (data/progressions/sel.csv cross_subject); each SEL row names its own SEL
341: unit, and the SEL frame sets its weeks, so no SEL week is given here. The two courses use one feelings chart (SEL's),
342: one calm-down card (SEL's calm-down steps), one I-statement (health's words, grade 3 form "I feel ___ when ___ because
343: ___. Please ___.") and one upstander plan (SEL's), so a skill is not taught twice in a year.
