docs/reviews/prework-health-gemini-2026-11-20.md:255:3. **Three outcome placements between the coverage map and `health.csv` (Finding 1).** Moving an outcome in or out of a band changes scope. **Recommended:** (a) mark `HECAT.FN.HBO12` as "met in 6 to 8" in the 9 to 12 coverage map (matching `health.csv`, where grade 9 does not teach it) rather than adding another grade 9 task; (b) add `HECAT.MEH.HBO3` to `g5-v-conflict-steps` so grades 3 to 5 match the map; (c) remove `HECAT.PHW.HBO12` from `g5-fn-claims-that-hurt` so PHW 12 stays in grade 7 as the map and Key state.
