ays in school life; no cause is chosen by the course. The teacher or a card plays the unkind act; no student plays it or the one laughed at. RS3: no student is asked to explain their own culture; the teammates' habits are invented children's, from a cited source. No ladders, no cleaning chemicals; gloves for any pick-up. Agent reads: sensitivity (the agent first studies the source for the teammates' habits); safety (improvement work). |
