ody tools at home when calm. Tools: the feelings faces chart with its scale, the calm-down plan card, the four-step stop-think-choose card, the think-feel-do chain sheet, scene cards. Curio Class writes the chart scale, both cards, the chain sheet, the scene cards, the page and the family note. Provisional cost for 30: about $10 printing. Out: a student's own feelings in a check (never asked); two characters' chains (unit 10). Begun here, owned in grade 5 (the band's owner year; the grade 5 unit that owns each is in the Seams table): CASEL.Self-Awareness.3, CASEL.Self-Awareness.5, CASEL.Self-Management.1, CASEL.Self-Management.2, CASEL.Responsible Decision-Making.5, CASEL.Responsible Decision-Making.6.
